      "statement": "NEPO uses a two-layer authorization model: authMiddleware (JWT verify + Redis jti blacklist check) is the first layer and attaches req.user with {userId, username, email, fullName, role, jti}; assetAuthMiddleware is a sibling that also accepts ?token= query for routes serving <img> tags (e.g. /api/photos).",
