      "id": "claim_878962ce732845f4af16c310ebc7b71f",
      "statement": "The socket.io /agent namespace authenticates in its handshake middleware (agentSocket.ts registerAuth): it reads auth.token, runs jwt.verify with config.jwtSecret and the same Redis jti blacklist check as authMiddleware, stores socket.data.user, and rejects with the same Vietnamese messages. The client caches one socket per token and reconnects (re-handshakes) whenever the token changes.",
